    "explanation": "Both parties: this is a route-deviation dispute decided under POLICY-ROUTE-DEVIATION (Ryde v2.1 §1). The platform's recorded distances show the trip was driven 8.3 km against a recommended 6.7 km — a deviation of 1.60 km, which is over the 1.0 km tolerance (POL-RD-22). The GPS trace (EV-GPS-05001) confirms which route was actually taken — Braddell Road and Toa Payoh Lorong 6 instead of Marymount Road — but, as POL-RD-22 directs, the sparse trace is not used to re-measure the distance; the 1.60 km comes from the trip record (EV-TRIP-05001) alone.\n\nTwo of the matrix limbs are settled on the record. Traffic justification fails: the LTA advisory for Marymount Road over the trip window (EV-ADVIS-05001-01) is type NONE, and POL-RD-23 accepts only congestion, an incident or a closure; the driver's general 'every morning sure jam' is a habit, not the real-time data the clause demands, and POL-RD-23 says expressly that a driver's bare assertion does not justify a reroute. Notification also fails: the chat log (EV-CHAT-05001) holds only two messages, both sent before the trip started (08:06:32 and 08:07:02, against an 08:09:02 start) and both about the pickup point, while the trip record's messages-during-trip and in-app-call lists are empty; the driver's own statement ('Didn't think need to say') concedes no notice was given. POL-RD-24 row (d) therefore applies — not traffic-justified, deviation over 1 km, no notice — and the excess distance fare is refunded in full.\n\nThat fare is deviation 1.60 km x per-km rate 0.72 SGD = 1.15 SGD, computed without surge as POL-RD-24 requires; the 2.51 SGD surge on the trip fare (EV-FARE-05001) is not part of this line and cannot inflate it. The rider asked for about 3.00 SGD; the policy measure allows 1.15 SGD of that, and the balance is not supported. The rider filed the dispute and is owed part of the contested charge, so the outcome is PARTIAL_REFUND of 1.15 SGD.\n\nNo escalation: the contested value is 3.00 SGD, below POL-GEN-22's 10.00 SGD band, so the AI ruling is final; neither profile carries a fraud flag, so the 0.95 uplift does not apply; every artifact carrying a deciding fact (EV-TRIP-05001, EV-CHAT-05001, EV-ADVIS-05001-01, EV-FARE-05001) is COMPLETE at weight_multiplier 1.0, and POL-RD-25's 0.80 confidence bar is met. POL-RD-25's 2 km ceiling is switched off (ai_ruling_max_deviation_applied is false) and in any event the deviation is 1.60 km, under it. POL-GEN-26 has no purchase — each fact the matrix needs is established by complete evidence. No clause here produces a referral, so none is made."
